WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.050
Dentist at nine-fifteen…

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.330
piano at four…

3
00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:08.370
and who's picking up Grandma?

4
00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:13.533
Family life runs on a thousand small things, scattered everywhere.

5
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:15.950
Meet FamSync.

6
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.397
One home for your family's plans, conversations, and memories.

7
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.670
Today gives you the whole day at a glance:

8
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.210
what's on, what's next, and what's overdue.

9
00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.310
And Family progress shows how goals and small wins

10
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.180
add up, in all the areas of your life.

11
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.270
The shared calendar keeps everyone in step.

12
00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:43.150
And every event has an audience: the whole family,

13
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.888
a few people, or just you.

14
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:50.430
Chores get assigned, repeat on schedule, and link to

15
00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.210
the events they're for.

16
00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.380
So when plans move, due dates move with them.

17
00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:00.710
Goals become progress everyone can see.

18
00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.960
Hours practiced, books read, dollars saved.

19
00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:10.850
Conversations live right next to the plans, with replies, reactions, and mentions.

20
00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:14.420
And files stay with exactly the people who need them.

21
00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:19.550
But a family isn't a list.

22
00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:26.392
It's a constellation: every person, every moment, quietly connected.

23
00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:32.670
This is Family Base: your family, as a living universe.

24
00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:36.790
Select anyone, and see everything they're connected to.

25
00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:42.280
People, plans, ideas, memories, places, and the everyday.

26
00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:47.850
Underneath, Family Base runs on a family ontology: designed

27
00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:52.690
around you and your family, where every connection means something.

28
00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:54.650
Grandma hosts Christmas morning.

29
00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:56.230
It happens at her house.

30
00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:58.760
And it lives on in last year's photos.

31
00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:04.790
And because everything is connected, you can simply ask.

32
00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:09.490
Family Base follows the connections.

33
00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:12.880
Michael is free on Wednesday, and he drove Grandma last week.

34
00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:15.794
One tap, and it's a task.

35
00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:19.190
Or ask what you did last Christmas, and your

36
00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:22.406
memories come right back.

37
00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:25.730
It understands how your family fits together, remembers what

38
00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:29.130
matters, and suggests what to do next.

39
00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:31.880
Privately, for your family alone.

40
00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:35.600
Always with you, wherever the day takes you.

41
00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:39.320
FamSync.

42
00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:41.950
Your family, connected.

